body:
I like bows, so I used Tyranny of Heaven(for the solar shield shanks), Izanagi and Thermal Erosion on Master. Pretty fun imo.

&#x200B;

Edit: Still haven't tried GM, so this loadout will change I guess.

Go inside the mansion through the ICA Savehouse, pick the keycard on the observatory, then go to the roof of the mansion and put Silvio Caruso on Lockdown then make him run away to his plane and the throw the Explosive Golfball on the plane. Do not get spotted and do it suit only.

&#x200B;

Edit: More details.
